    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "calling it a \"talking point from the wealthy elite\" sounds pretty biased though. shouldn't an economic analysis focus on the actual fiscal reality of capital mobility rather than questioning the motives of the people making the argument? it feels like you're dismissing a core economic principle just to defend a certain political stance.",
